<Tag Name="PC_To_PLC_DINT" Class="Standard" TagType="Base" DataType="DINT" Dimensions="100" Radix="Decimal" Constant="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write">
<Comments>
<Comment Operand="[10].0">
<![CDATA[PC_TT_Clear_Data, Set to 1 when pressed - Allow PLC to clear]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand="[10].1">
<![CDATA[PC_TT_Run, Set to 1 when pressed - Allow PLC to clear]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand="[10].2">
<![CDATA[PC_Trigger_Cognex, Set to 1 when pressed - Allow PLC to clear]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand="[10].3">
<![CDATA[PC_Door_Open_Request, Set to 1 when pressed - Allow PLC to clear]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand="[10].4">
<![CDATA[PC_Part_to_Chute, Momentary Button Press from Optix will set to 1 and allow PLC to Clear. When Button is held for 2 seconds, Optix will set to 1 and either prevent a clear from PLC or continuously set to 1.]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand="[10].5">
<![CDATA[PC_Stacker_Cmd
, When this bit is 1 PC is able to make Stacker layer adjustments]]>
</Comment>
<Comment Operand="[50]">
